  "description": "They were lost to the apocalypse… now they’re yours to claim.\n\nIn Zombie Hearts: Turn the Undead into Anime Boys, every battle brings you closer to something dangerous, intense… and impossible to resist.\n\nExplore infected zones crawling with the undead. Fight, weaken, and capture them… then transform them into captivating anime boys with a dark, post-apocalyptic allure.\n\n♥ HUNT, CAPTURE AND REVIVE\nFace relentless hordes of zombies and turn your enemies into something far more tempting: your ideal anime boys.\n\n♥ FROM DECAY TO DESIRE\nEach boy carries the essence of what he once was. Strong, mysterious, wild… now reborn with a seductive edge that’s hard to ignore.\n\n♥ BUILD DESIRE AND CONNECTION\nGet closer to the boys you capture. Unlock intimate moments, deepen your bond, and uncover their hidden sides.\n\n♥ GROW STRONGER, GO FURTHER\nEarn rewards, upgrade your skills, and dominate increasingly dangerous encounters. The stronger you become, the more irresistible they are.\n\n♥ UNLOCK EXCLUSIVE MOMENTS\nProgress to reveal special scenes and unique interactions. Every victory pulls you deeper into their world.\n\n\nIn a world overrun by the undead… will you control them, or give in to them?",
